      "id": "claim_3fa0f367129b46bbb9d7148912470fa4",
      "statement": "get_current_user verifies the Supabase bearer token against the project JWKS with RS256 or ES256, the configured audience and derived issuer, using a PyJWKClient cached per JWKS URL; any PyJWTError or missing sub becomes a 401 AuthError logged only by exception type, and an unconfigured Supabase yields a 401 explaining the missing settings.",
